==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**8 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Gobble]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since the Gobbles shred your cats with their attacks, you want them to miss every shot. Since they have a low standing range, the best way to counter them is to not meatshield. [[:Category:Cats with Toxic Immunity|Toxic-immune]] or [[:Category:Cats with Curse ability|Curse-inflicting]] Cats work very well here.

